  "description": "Fleeing from workplace harassment by his senior, Song-woo escapes down to the countryside. After locking himself away in a farmhouse for a year, he runs into Do-yeol, a young man brimming with wild instincts. Even Song-woo, who usually puts up walls around any human male, finds his guard dropping in front of this man who somehow feels more like a canine mammal than anything else...\n\n*“That just now... wasn’t an animal, it was a person... right?”* *(Source: Lezhin, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/thatwolf), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/thatwolf)",
